#> source: G
# 1. Double-space a file. Pement: sed G
# G appends the hold space to the pattern space, with a newline between. The
# hold space starts out empty, so every line gains an empty line after it.
# The data is a short list of US states; later steps add blank lines and
# duplicates to it on purpose.
# Try: G;G triple-spaces (the sheet's next entry).
G

#DATA
Alabama
Alaska
Iowa
Kansas
Montana
